      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARRAIGE (2) doesn't win out of turn, scoring just four times from 65 starts. Again tasted defeat last start when eighth over 1800m at Port Macquarie, beaten 5 lengths. Has the talent to feature in the finish. GUNFIGHTER ROAD (3) is yet to fill a placing in two runs since resuming from a spell, the latest when ninth over 1600m at Nowra after he was in contention on the turn. Cherry-ripe now and looks a clear threat. THE ADIGE (1) turned in a moderate run over this journey last time out, settling out the back and failing to come on when tenth over 1600m at Randwick. Perfectly placed and is sure to give this a mighty shake. YES I WIN (7) ran a better race last start, finishing 3.5 lengths away in fourth over 1600m at Tumut. No surprise to see him in contention.",
